Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/bad_map_key.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val m: Map<List<Int>, Int> = [:];
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`
